        "original_id": "68778448-5d51-5f6a-94c3-23164c7b8f7e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Terri Nunn, Sonya Scarlet, Virginia Macolino\n- Organizations: Berlin, Theatres des Vampires\n- Products: Information, Candyland\n- Roles: singer, actress, lyricist, lead vocals\n- Topics: acting career, album recording, musical style, lyrical themes\n\nFacts:\n- Terri Nunn was born on June 26, 1961, and she is an American singer and actress.\n- Sonya Scarlet was born on April 2, 1980, and she is the singer and lyricist of the Italian extreme gothic metal band Theatres des Vampires.\n- During the recording period of Berlin's album Information, Terri Nunn had temporarily left the band to pursue an acting career, and Virginia Macolino performed the lead vocals.\n- Theatres des Vampires' album Candyland features Sonya Scarlet on vocals, is more guitar-driven than the band's previous releases, and focuses less on the vampiric and occult themes for which the band is known.",
